 903               /IT ASSEMBLES ALL PARAMETERS
 904               /TYPES ARE:     RC=00   ABSOLUTE CONSTANT
 905               /               RC=01   RELOCATABLE ADDRESS
 906               /               RC=05   CDF TO CURRENT FIELD
