3623               /SETSUB IS A UTILITY USED BY SETCT ONLY.
3624               /USED ONLY IMMEDIATELY AFTER A PST SEARCH.
3625               /CALLING SEQUENCE:      JMS     SPSTB
3626               /               CMA             /SPSTB MAY SKIP
3627               /               JMS     SETSUB
3628               /               RETURN IF SPSTB SKIPPED OVER CMA
3629               /               RETURN IF SPSTB DID NOT SKIP
3630               /HAS SEVERAL FUNCTIONS:
3631               /(1) SAVE COPY OF OLD VALUE OF OBACTR BEFORE
3632               /CHANGING STARTS- SO IT MAY BE USED AT SETC13.
3633               /(2) IF INSTR IS INDIRECT, THAT'S IT- EXIT
3634               /(3) OTHERWISE SAVE OLD VALUE OF PST CODE BITS 10-11
