3816               /       LOCATES (OR ENTERS) IT IN PAGE SYM.TAB.
3817               /       AND SETS THE DEFINED-ON-PAGE BIT IN
3818               /       THE PST CODE WORD.
3819               /       ALSO SETS BANK CONDITION TO UNKNOWN
