3824               /       IN PASS1 WE MUST ALSO DO THE
3825               /       FOLLOWING IF THE SYMBOL IS ALREADY
3826               /       IN THE PST WHEN WE GO LOOK FOR
3827               /       IT: (1) REDUCE THE OFF-PAGE SYM.
3828               /       CTR.  BECAUSE OFF-PAGE POINTER (FOR
3829               /       EITHER NORMAL OR # REFERENCES) ARE
3830               /       NO LONGER NEEDED.  (2) REDUCE
3831               /       OBACTR BY THE NO. OF EXTRA WORDS
3832               /       OF CODE DUE TO THIS SYMBOL.
